Replace-From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Replace-Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 04:22:54 +0800
Subject: ARM: hisi: add Hi3798MV100 SMP support


The Hi3798MV100 is a four Cortex-A7 ARMv7 part with no PSCI and no power
controller firmware, so the kernel brings the secondary cores up itself.
The reset requests of cores 1..3 are still asserted when Linux first
looks, so a core only starts running when its own reset is dropped and
no holding pen is needed; hotplug that lets the dying core reset itself
hangs the cluster after a handful of cycles because the broadcast cache
maintenance the other cores issue loses its respondent.
Release a core by dropping its arm, cluster_dbg and arm_por resets
around a CPU_SW_BEGIN pulse through the 0xffff0000 trampoline page, park
the dying core in WFI held in reset by the surviving core, and wait
briefly in cpu_kill since the CRG has no parked-status bit.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)


diff --git a/arch/arm/mach-hisi/hotplug.c b/arch/arm/mach-hisi/hotplug.c
index f5655ad1c351..b84b2b83ddfc 100644
--- a/arch/arm/mach-hisi/hotplug.c
+++ b/arch/arm/mach-hisi/hotplug.c
@@ -54,7 +54,7 @@
 #define CPU0_SRST_REQ_EN		(1 << 0)
 
 #define HIX5HD2_PERI_CRG20		0x50
-#define CRG20_CPU1_RESET		(1 << 17)
+#define CRG20_ARM_SRST(i)		BIT((i) + 16)
 
 #define HIX5HD2_PERI_PMC0		0x1000
 #define PMC0_CPU1_WAIT_MTCOMS_ACK	(1 << 8)
@@ -203,7 +203,7 @@
 		writel_relaxed(val, ctrl_base + HIX5HD2_PERI_PMC0);
 		/* unreset */
 		val = readl_relaxed(ctrl_base + HIX5HD2_PERI_CRG20);
-		val &= ~CRG20_CPU1_RESET;
+		val &= ~CRG20_ARM_SRST(cpu);
 		writel_relaxed(val, ctrl_base + HIX5HD2_PERI_CRG20);
 	} else {
 		/* power down cpu1 */
@@ -211,10 +211,9 @@
 		val |= PMC0_CPU1_PMC_ENABLE | PMC0_CPU1_POWERDOWN;
 		val &= ~PMC0_CPU1_WAIT_MTCOMS_ACK;
 		writel_relaxed(val, ctrl_base + HIX5HD2_PERI_PMC0);
-
 		/* reset */
 		val = readl_relaxed(ctrl_base + HIX5HD2_PERI_CRG20);
-		val |= CRG20_CPU1_RESET;
+		val |= CRG20_ARM_SRST(cpu);
 		writel_relaxed(val, ctrl_base + HIX5HD2_PERI_CRG20);
 	}
 }
